      "comment": "ONE GOLDEN DEAL (7) resumes from a spell of 12 weeks after closing off last campaign in good form, scoring at her last appearance over 2200m at Horsham. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw but note that she won a hot form race fresh alst time and expecting a bright start to the campaign again. CO CAPTAIN (5) was struggling to make his mark before the latest appearance when he scored by 2.5 metres over 2138m at Albion Park. Goes in as the danger off that. COVERED IN GOLD (9) is flying at present with two successive wins to his name, most recently at Shepparton eight days ago. Chance to keep the ball rolling while BETTOR PUNTER NZ (4) must be included on the back of some solid recent form. Good most recently when second at Kilmore over 2180m.",
